# tests/subst/composed.rxtin -- a COMPOSED rx for the subst cells (subst_api.md
# §3¶3): `piece`'s exported group is delivered at site `d`, so the target
# declares no group of its own (ngroups 0) while ncaps is 2. A template's
# no-map form is refused against it at the context setup.
target = user

pattern (?&d=piece)
name user

pattern (?<kept>a)
name piece
export kept
